   "id": 524259,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/579680c603cfa536.jpg\" alt=\"The figure shows a table with nutritional values of different types of meat, milk, and eggs. The type of food items are listed in the first column, the carbohydrate content in the second, protein in the third, fat in the fourth, ash in the fifth, and water in the sixth. Note below the table states: Ash contains the minerals.\n\nIn the first row is the snail meat containing 2.93 g carbohydrates, 20.7 g protein, 1.21 g fat, 1.49 g ash, 73.7 g water. The next group relates to beef, pork, and lamb (the values will be given respectively in this order). Carbohydrate content  undetermined for all three, 17.5 g, 11.9 g, 15.7 g of protein; 22 g, 45 g, 27.7 g of fat; 0.9 g, 0.6 g, 0.8 g ash; and 60 g, 42 g, 56 g of water.\n\nThe third group is poultry meat: chicken, duck, turkey, dried fish. Carbohydrates are undetermined for all four, 20.2 g, 16.2 g, 20.2 g, 60.2 g of protein; 12.6 g, 30 g, 20.2 g, 21 g of fat; 1 g of ash for each meat and 15 g for dried fish; and 81.8 g, 68.6 g, 79.3 g, 4 g of water.\n\nFourth are milks: whole cow milk and goat milk. Their content respectively is 5 g, 4.5 g of carbohydrates; 3.5 g, 3.8 g of protein; 3.8 g, 4.8 g fat; 0.7 g, 0.8 g ash; and 87.3 g, 86.4 g water. \n\nThe last set of data is related to eggs, small amount of egg white, and small amount of egg yolk, in that order. They contain respectively 10.5 g, 15.5 g of carbohydrates; small amount of protein, 33.5 g in yolk; 1 g each in both of fat; and 88 g, 49.5 g of ash. There is no data on water.\n\">\n(credit: modification of work by Acham, Israel Okpunyi et al./<i>Asian Food Science Journal</i>)\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>The table shows the nutritional value of various meats and other food items.</p>\n<p>Eating 100 g of which type of food would give the most proteins?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1029292,
     "content_html": "turkey"
    },
    {
     "id": 1029293,
     "content_html": "dried fish"
    },
    {
     "id": 1029294,
     "content_html": "cow milk"
    },
    {
     "id": 1029295,
     "content_html": "goat milk"
    }
